  "content": {
    "en": "21st.dev is the open component marketplace and registry for Design Engineers. Built on the shadcn component distribution pattern, it enables creators worldwide to share interactive components, experimental shaders, and production-ready blocks with live interactive sandboxes and one-click CLI installations.",
    "zh": "21st.dev 是面向设计工程师群体的开放式组件分发平台与社区 Registry。基于 shadcn 的解耦分发机制，它汇聚了全球独立创作者分享的前沿微交互、WebGL 着色器以及精雕细琢的页面区块，支持实时在线沙盒预览与一键 CLI 本地导入。"
  },
